sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant REST as REST Controller
    participant Handler as Exception Handler
    participant StdErr as StandardError
    participant Response as HTTP Response

    Client->>REST: HTTP Request
    Note over Client: Client initiates request to REST endpoint

    REST->>REST: Exception occurs during processing
    Note over REST: Exception thrown in controller method

    REST->>Handler: Exception propagates
    Note over Handler: Global exception handler catches exception

    Handler->>StdErr: new StandardError(exception)
    Note over StdErr: StandardError object instantiated with exception details

    Handler->>StdErr: setTimestamp(System.currentTimeMillis())
    Note over StdErr: Timestamp set to current time

    alt Exception is ObjectNotFoundException
        Handler->>StdErr: setStatus(404)
        Note over StdErr: HTTP 404 Not Found status assigned
    else Exception is UnsupportedEncodingException
        Handler->>StdErr: setStatus(400)
        Note over StdErr: HTTP 400 Bad Request status assigned
    else Other Exception
        Handler->>StdErr: setStatus(httpStatusCode)
        Note over StdErr: HTTP status code assigned based on exception type
    end

    Handler->>StdErr: setError(exception.getClass().getSimpleName())
    Note over StdErr: Error type extracted from exception

    Handler->>StdErr: setMessage(exception.getMessage())
    Note over StdErr: Error message extracted from exception

    Handler->>StdErr: setPath(requestPath)
    Note over StdErr: Request path captured from HTTP request

    Handler->>StdErr: serialize to JSON
    Note over StdErr: StandardError object serialized to JSON format

    Handler->>Response: return ResponseEntity with JSON body
    Note over Response: HTTP response with error details in JSON format

    Response->>Client: HTTP Response with error status and JSON body
    Note over Client: JSON error response returned to client